    "body": "fix on issue/1442-lathe-chuck-fixtures · PR #1469 · pinned by three_jaw_envelope_is_pinned, four_jaw_has_four_jaws_at_quarters, collet_envelope_is_pinned, jaw_chuck_nonsense_is_refused_by_name, collet_nonsense_is_refused_by_name, a_generated_chuck_is_steel_the_holder_law_reads, a_chuck_fits_on_round_stock_and_refuses_by_name, lathe_chucks_are_placed_fitted_to_the_stock_and_undone_over_mcp · merges at the next cut\n\nFirst slice (Refs, does not close): 3-jaw, 4-jaw and collet chucks as generated accessories, fit to round stock over MCP. The rest (UI fit toggle, inside grip, stepped jaws, 4-jaw offsets, rpm limit, 4th-axis chuck, skill row) is #1468.\n",
