    "body": "The initial chuck implementation is already on upstream/main. PR #1469 merged as a07f43a403d91dbe4dfc88880fed088a7c89a642, and git merge-base --is-ancestor confirms that commit is on upstream/main.\n\nThe tree contains the chuck generators in crates/sim/src/chuck.rs, stock fitting in crates/app/src/accessory/chuck.rs, generation pins in crates/sim/tests/lathe_chuck.rs, and the collision refusal pin a_generated_chuck_is_steel_the_holder_law_reads in crates/app/tests/lathe_chuck.rs. I inspected these references; I did not run the tests.\n\nThe prior implementation report explicitly leaves the remaining requirements to open issue #1468. This does not establish that every original requirement is complete. Stopping without a claim or code changes to avoid duplicating the merged implementation or working the separately tracked follow-up.\n",
