    "updated_at": "2026-11-14T21:48:08Z",
    "body": "This issue's \"Done means\" items are already on `upstream/main` from PR #1469 (merge commit `a07f43a403d91dbe4dfc88880fed088a7c89a642`).\n\n- Parametric 3-jaw, 4-jaw, and collet chuck generators and named validation live in `crates/sim/src/chuck.rs`.\n- `accessory::KINDS` in `crates/app/src/accessory.rs` includes `three_jaw_chuck`, `four_jaw_chuck`, and `collet_chuck`, and `crates/ui/src/egui_app/fixture_accessory_dialog.rs` lists them in the Add accessory dialog.\n- `crates/app/src/accessory/chuck.rs` and `crates/app/src/commands/accessory.rs` provide `fit_to_stock` (`AccessoryPlacement::OnStock`) with undo and redo via `InsertAccessory` and `SetAccessory`.\n- `crates/app/src/mcp/accessory_tools.rs` exposes the chuck kinds and `fit_to_stock` through `add_accessory` and `set_accessory`.\n- Generation, fit, refusal, MCP, and turning holder collision pins are present in `crates/sim/tests/lathe_chuck.rs`, `crates/app/tests/lathe_chuck.rs`, and `crates/app/tests/mcp_accessory.rs`.\n\nPR #1469 used `Refs #1442` instead of closing the issue and moved the remaining items (UI fit-to-stock toggle, viewport verification, inside grip, stepped jaws, 4-jaw offsets, rpm limit, 4th-axis chuck, and `camcraft-mcp` skill row) into open issue #1468. Stopping without claiming or editing code.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
